Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:03.72,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,What's this grade-schooler doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.72,0:00:05.05,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,R-Raion!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:06.98,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Why are you with these guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:09.11,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Y-You traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.53,0:00:11.96,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Raion, is this kid any good?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:13.51,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Nah, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.51,0:00:17.14,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Haruto told me what Rights you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:19.34,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You'll have no problem taking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:22.63,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,So that means he's a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:27.64,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You're an officer like me, \Nbut Haruto treats me like his favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:30.97,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Let's get you a win here so he \Ngives you the props you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.23,0:00:33.66,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Raion, you're so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:35.20,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,All right, Omi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:36.97,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You ready for what's coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:39.58,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,R-Raion, don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:42.49,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You should be begging Kai, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.49,0:00:44.44,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:49.07,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,You're gonna use your Rights \Nand put me in danger, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.15,0:00:52.91,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:55.46,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.88,0:00:57.33,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I reject!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:00:59.96,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Checkmate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:16.51,Show Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:31.78,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That's checkmate!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:34.49,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You've been rejected by \Nthe Prime Right of Rejection.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.49,0:02:39.18,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You won't be able to use your Rights \Nagainst Omi or endanger him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:40.43,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:43.34,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Now that I've rejected any potential harm,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.34,0:02:47.27,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,this is basically a safe zone \Nand I can protect Raion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.94,0:02:49.63,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,It's practically the Evasion Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.27,0:02:52.72,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Rejection Right? He's the owner?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:54.82,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Raion, what the hell's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:59.28,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Me joining you guys is all one big lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:00.53,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:05.16,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be under the influence \Nof the Negotiation Right, like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:08.33,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Your ability to steal Rights with \Nthe Mortgage Right is a big threat,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:10.17,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,but the Rejection Right can block your powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:14.96,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm only here to catch you off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:16.86,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Besides, I don't have any Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:20.14,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,So your Mortgage Right \Nposes zero risk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.46,0:03:22.43,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Raion, why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:23.43,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:27.44,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,We've got no ammo so... Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:28.10,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.10,0:03:30.56,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,What? You've gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:32.07,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:36.99,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're just stalling. What now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.99,0:03:38.99,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,{\i1}Should I report back to the Emperor?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.46,0:03:43.15,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,{\i1}But His Majesty would believe Raion over me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.15,0:03:46.79,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,{\i1}And he'd be hurt to know Raion betrayed him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:49.64,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll pretend Raion died in an ambush.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.64,0:03:52.44,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've gotta kill him myself \Nand take back his body.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:54.07,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's for the best.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.29,0:04:07.18,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see right through your plan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.69,0:04:12.06,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Superficies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.60,0:04:20.57,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,How did he catch up with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:23.47,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:28.35,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,I'll separate you two \Nwithout harming the kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:31.33,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,then kill you once you're defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:34.30,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Your only other option is \Nto fall to your death—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.57,0:04:38.69,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,{\i1}The floor was a screen?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:41.74,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,A trap hole! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:45.30,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Nothing beats Gobo's Presentation Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:48.84,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,All right. I'm off to the next phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:52.10,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Roger that. I'll make sure to evacuate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:55.50,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is where we get to \Nthe heart of our plan!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:57.81,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:00.03,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,We've got some time to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:03.78,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Sure! No one can bother us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.18,0:05:07.91,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,My space is safe from the Visualization \NRight and Transillumination Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:10.25,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,No one can hear us either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:13.25,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Nice getup as usual, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.61,0:05:16.03,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,This is the customary gear for magicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.03,0:05:19.63,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,It's how we hide our tricks and gimmicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:21.48,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,"Gimmicks," you say...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:24.14,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Does that include the deaths of your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:28.68,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Wasn't there a way to do this without
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:32.09,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,sacrificing Shinozaki, Souma, or Rika?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:35.56,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Death isn't really all that important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:39.91,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,What's important is me, \NSudo-kun, Raion-kun, Gobo-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.91,0:05:41.59,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,and you, Iruga-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:48.33,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Anyone else's death \Nisn't worth calling a "sacrifice".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:52.00,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Jeez, you can be scary sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:54.17,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe you're \Nrelated to Teppei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:56.70,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,But I like that about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:06:01.97,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,So is reconciling not an option?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:06.28,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:10.15,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,When it comes to family, \Nshe loses sight of anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:13.38,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Becoming Queen has only \Nworsened that side of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:16.32,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,so I doubt she has any capacity for reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:17.98,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:20.94,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,It's all for our best chances of winning...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.43,0:06:22.95,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,That's what it comes down to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:24.29,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.29,0:06:27.02,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,That vital piece of information...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:28.91,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Is it confirmed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:32.12,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:34.17,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have commenced without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:38.38,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we'd be operating \Nunder a different strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:42.16,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You did save one usage \Nof your Suspension Right
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:44.06,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,this entire time for that exact reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.06,0:06:45.66,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.66,0:06:48.72,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,But was this really necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:50.32,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:52.72,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Based on our best chances...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:55.74,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Death is death, and life is life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:58.06,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,The Resurrection Right is in enemy hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:03.69,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,So death is our best cover \Nto evade their surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:05.23,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.23,0:07:08.25,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,They don't seem to be \Naccounting for the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.53,0:07:11.91,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:15.26,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Since we're technically \Nsupposed to be in battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:18.67,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I figured we might as well \Nleave traces of combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.08,0:07:21.09,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.09,0:07:23.28,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Then I'll divide things up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:33.95,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Oops, maybe I overdid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:37.02,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I prefer to be more flashy \Non the dance floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.39,0:07:40.98,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Is it about time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.95,0:07:45.80,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I'll get going, but before I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:48.71,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,What's the extent of what you already knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:51.41,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,and how much of this is speculation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:52.94,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Who knows? Other than...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:58.15,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Magicians always have tricks \Nup their sleeve for stage time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:02.96,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Then I'll leave this space for you to hide in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:06.47,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I'll make sure the Presentation \NRight can reach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:08.48,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:10.21,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:21.33,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,They're late. No one's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:23.47,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Could they still be in battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.05,0:08:30.26,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,It might be worth using the Recovery Right \Nto gather bodies just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:32.13,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}Raion...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:35.10,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he safe? Don't tell me you're dead.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:36.83,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Hey! Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.01,0:08:39.24,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Raion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:44.25,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You're safe! Thank god!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:48.17,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,They got Kai! And it's not just him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.17,0:08:50.61,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,They got all of us besides me and Iruga!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:52.27,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,W-What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:57.00,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Iruga secluded Yagihashi \Nin his space division.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:09:00.09,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,He's checking the area now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.09,0:09:03.65,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I was able to escape somehow \Nand met up with Iruga.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:06.72,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Access the Mother Light.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:08.90,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Engage the Rights Cloud.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:10.93,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Right of Supervision.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:22.54,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,He's right. They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:23.94,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,What about Seraphiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:25.55,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,He seems to be dead, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.55,0:09:28.84,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,The enemies are also lying still, \Nso I assume both sides perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:33.74,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't expect them to take down Seraphiel!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:35.42,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it's no problem.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:37.85,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,{\i1}Iruga's Division Right can handle them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.57,0:09:41.82,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides, we've got the Recovery Right \Nand Resurrection Right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:44.27,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll revive them as many times as necessary!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:47.19,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,Haruto, recover the bodies and—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.19,0:09:48.05,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:51.86,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,They may have expected that and set a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.59,0:09:54.57,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course! The Suspension Right!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:09:56.83,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,{\i1}With Tojuro, it's possible.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:09:58.85,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Big sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.85,0:10:01.58,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,Raion, stay with Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:02.87,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:05.41,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,Kou, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:13.35,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,We need to defeat Tojuro \Nbefore we can revive anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.35,0:10:15.15,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,Can you go out to battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.15,0:10:17.26,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,If necessary, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:22.85,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I've used the Concealment Right to hide \Nthe Mother Light in the church's basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.15,0:10:26.03,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,All ownerless Rights are within the Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.03,0:10:30.86,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I can freely extract any Right \Nwith this authorization device.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.39,0:10:34.48,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,Just to be safe, can you give me \Nthe Resurrection Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:37.74,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,and Haruto the Evasion Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:39.69,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.22,0:10:43.33,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You're really going, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:45.47,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I promise I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.47,0:10:47.00,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.39,0:10:50.22,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Raion! I believe in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:51.46,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Swear, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.33,0:10:53.28,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:11:01.45,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,Haruto, you still own the Numbers Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.45,0:11:03.14,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,We could use Tasuketsu to—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:04.91,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I don't wanna do Tasuketsu anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:08.83,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Big bro died because of Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:13.74,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,The hell I went through \Nat the Camp changed me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.31,0:11:16.95,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,but I never should have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:19.91,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What I did was wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:24.90,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I wanna look big bro straight \Nin the eye when he wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:27.48,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,So even if it's just starting now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:30.34,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'm letting go of Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:32.19,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,Haruto...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:35.77,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Besides, I wanna believe and wait for Raion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:40.70,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It's been a long time \Nsince I could believe in someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:42.60,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I forgot how good it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:46.55,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,You're right. Let's wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:50.47,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,{\i1}Raion...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.95,0:11:55.09,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps the reason you appeared \Nbefore us was to save Haruto.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:57.96,Show Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,245)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:07.89,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,There! It's Iruga!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.37,0:12:11.20,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Good thing we found each other without issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.20,0:12:12.84,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Now let's get back to—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.72,0:12:15.80,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Extended space division.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:22.55,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Iruga?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:26.32,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Now you're cut off physically, \Nqualitatively, and perceptively.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:29.82,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I wonder if you can pull from the Mother now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.17,0:12:32.56,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Too bad I know everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:36.03,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You should be more careful of wiretapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:38.97,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That's the deal, Kou.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.97,0:12:41.08,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,We're taking you down here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.08,0:12:44.48,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I see, so you two were both with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.09,0:12:46.54,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,But you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.37,0:12:50.83,Comp very big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1)\pos(320,45)}Re-execution Right
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.54,0:12:50.83,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,My inherent Prime Right \Nis the Re-execution Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:56.76,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,If I trace back my memory, \NI can pull any Right from my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:13:00.30,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,That Isshiki lady's Prime Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:02.59,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You sure brag a lot about hand-me-downs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:06.08,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I gotta focus on maintaining \Nthis extended space division!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:08.14,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you! Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:09.78,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Iruga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:11.06,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I pulled good ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:20.84,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Ready, Raion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:22.28,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Let's go, Iruga!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:24.11,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Transmutation Attribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.11,0:13:26.45,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Scission!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:29.50,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Space division!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:37.45,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,That's how you chopped up Yohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.45,0:13:38.80,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Scary stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:39.85,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Transmutation Attribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.85,0:13:42.01,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Confluence!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:47.64,Italics,Iruga,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:49.64,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Divide to maximum limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:51.60,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Airspace Defense Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:54.10,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}He blocked it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.53,0:13:58.07,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're in trouble if he can \Ndefend spatial attacks.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:13:59.40,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Deactivation Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:00.53,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.93,0:14:06.26,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's good.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:11.16,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}And most of my focus is on \Npreserving this extended space.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:15.50,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}I may not be able to keep up with this guy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:19.88,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}It'll be over for them \Nwithout Iruga's Division Right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:21.21,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,This isn't a whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.63,0:14:33.57,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Prime Right of Falsification \Nunder the Permission Attribute.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:39.59,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}The ability to touch objects and falsify \Ntruths about them for five seconds.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.34,0:14:43.96,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}In this case, I falsified \Nthe statement "not a whip"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:47.78,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}and turned the steel rod \Ninto a whip for five seconds.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:52.51,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can only falsify one statement \Nper object at a time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.51,0:14:56.29,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aside from life and death, I can \Nenforce simple state transitions.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.59,0:14:58.09,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the rundown, Iruga.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.09,0:14:59.25,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Got that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.25,0:15:02.80,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}And we're using telepathy through \Nthe Right of Communion
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.80,0:15:04.76,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}under the Permission Attribute, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:07.76,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}It may come with restrictions, but not bad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:10.81,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}Prime Right\NRight
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:11.94,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah, considering I just got them...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:13.65,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm pretty happy to have these Rights!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.54,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Raion Ouno.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:18.39,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rights unknown.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.39,0:15:19.52,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.28,0:15:23.26,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Permission Attribute. \NPrime Right of Suppression,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.53,0:15:26.17,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,My Division Right's vanishing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:27.28,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Isolation Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:28.42,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Iruga?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.97,0:15:31.04,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Oh boy. My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.04,0:15:34.79,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've suppressed his Division Right \Nand locked him up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:36.46,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}While I have the chance...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:37.92,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll kill Raion!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.21,0:15:40.92,Italics,Raion,0,0,0,,How is this dude stronger than Iruga?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:42.92,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,This isn't a cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:49.97,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's gone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:51.11,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}No.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.90,0:15:57.60,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,The ground from this \Npoint forward isn't liquid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.99,0:16:01.06,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Suppress infall velocity.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:05.68,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not working.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:10.20,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That should stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.84,0:16:17.54,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prime Right of Recurrence.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:19.50,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:22.94,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perceptive division.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:23.04,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(98.667,194.889)}Closed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:25.71,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}Divide the kanji character of "closed".{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.74,0:16:30.25,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,And that makes the kanji for "gate".
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.25,0:16:32.43,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,My Right's pretty versatile, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:34.89,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:44.70,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Iruga! What's he up to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.53,0:16:49.52,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,He's trying to deactivate \Nmy extended space division.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:56.04,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,So you can only attack \Nthrough physical division?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:59.74,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,That's right. Not to mention, \NI'll need to hit my target perfectly
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.74,0:17:02.54,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,if I wanna use my maximum space division.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:07.67,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,190}Airspace Defense Right
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.01,0:17:06.43,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Besides, Kou likely owns \Nthe Airspace Defense Right
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:08.06,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,that used to belong to the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.06,0:17:12.60,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,It's a Prime Right that \Nblocks all airborne attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.06,0:17:16.60,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Which means only a mole can \Nattack him at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:18.30,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Gimme a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:21.06,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,So our only choice is to attack \Nfrom underground?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:22.46,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:25.52,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,So? What's the range \Nof your Falsification Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:29.74,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I can activate it within 15 meters \Nof where I touch the object.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:31.85,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,So that's not an option...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:34.35,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Either way, we'll have to stop him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.35,0:17:35.99,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:38.05,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Qualitative division.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.05,0:17:40.63,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Divide 100 meters by 100 \Nand transport ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:48.89,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, I was supposed to pass you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.89,0:17:52.29,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You still suppressing my division powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.19,0:17:58.80,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Space division.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.37,0:18:02.56,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Deactivation Right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:07.56,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Space division!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.21,0:18:18.77,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,That should hold him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.77,0:18:21.41,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Transmutation Attribute. \NPrime Right of Penetration.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.48,0:18:25.83,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Oh boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:31.08,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:33.09,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,That won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.35,0:18:35.34,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You're looking the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:37.85,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Divide to maximum limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.35,0:18:41.32,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me? It's no—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:43.32,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,A piece of cloth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:50.86,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,An arm from underground!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:56.20,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Falsification!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:57.95,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Division!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:18:59.15,Default,Iruga/Raion,0,0,0,,Joint exercise!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.28,0:19:00.79,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(99.556,71.333)}Joint exercise!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.15,0:19:00.79,Default,Iruga/Raion,0,0,0,,Divide to maximum limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.16,0:19:00.79,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(540.445,86.445)}Divide to \Nmaximum limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:06.54,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Impossible! Recurren... ce...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:10.04,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.55,0:19:13.78,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,"Iruga's arm isn't connected to the ground."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.78,0:19:15.01,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Or so you thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:17.51,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,That's how it's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.29,0:19:24.42,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I was confused when you mentioned \Nconnecting my arm to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:27.73,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,That plan came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:30.44,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You got the perfect aim, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.29,0:19:32.43,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Alrighty then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.43,0:19:34.59,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,We defeated Kou as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:37.45,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You moving on to the final phase?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.45,0:19:40.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah. But before that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:46.97,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Teppei-chan's fifth envelope \Nof commands: "Love."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:51.84,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Do you still have the envelope \Nto retain the Obedience Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.27,0:19:53.73,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.73,0:19:56.80,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,It's been safe with me this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:19:58.85,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.25,0:20:05.83,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to use this according \Nto Yagihashi and Sudo's plan, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:09.78,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm going against their orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.55,0:20:13.09,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I know how important this is to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:19.16,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,So it's only right \Nthat I do this in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.71,0:20:22.43,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Iruga, I hope you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.13,0:20:27.04,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,This is a symbol of my conviction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.19,0:20:32.35,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I understand, Raion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.15,0:20:35.84,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:38.79,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Thanks, Iruga!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.35,0:20:51.31,Phone,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(358,80)\frz11}Sudo: Clear\N\N\N\NRaion, Omi: Clear \N\N\N\NNishime: Clear\N\N\N\NEren, Hikari: Clear
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.83,0:20:50.36,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Looks like we're all ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:54.52,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Same goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.52,0:20:58.19,Phone,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz11}Sudo: Clear\N\N\N\NRaion, Omi: Clear \N\N\N\NNishime: Clear\N\N\N\NEren, Hikari: Clear\N\N\N\NRyuta, Knight, \NDummy: Clear {20:55; row five}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:20:58.19,Phone,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\frz9\c&H68736C&\b0\pos(355.111,290.223)\3c&HF7FDFD&}Yagihashi:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.48,0:21:02.20,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Now, let's begin turning the wheel of fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:04.03,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Suspension Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.55,0:21:05.96,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Release all Activations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:20.01,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,Showdown
